  "interpretation": "Durations are monotonic wall time in microseconds, including instrumentation overhead. Aggregates are reported per run and per process; never sum phase totals as end-to-end latency because parent durations include children. self_us subtracts direct children only and is unknown for a source/process with an unobserved parent or observed queue loss. A null value with an accompanying *_unknown reason is an explicit unknown, not zero. Complete counts describe matched scope pairs, not a complete observation tree or product success. Scope completion is not a physical send and implies no cause. started_unix_us is for log correlation only; wall-clock changes do not affect elapsed_us."
